# 🛒 Super Store Sales Prediction Using KNN Regression

A Machine Learning web application that predicts **Super Store product sales** using the **K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) Regression** algorithm.

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is designed to predict product sales based on different product and outlet features. The Machine Learning model is developed using **Python** and **Scikit-learn** and deployed using **Flask**.

The trained KNN Regression model is saved in `.pkl` format and used by the Flask application to generate real-time sales predictions through a web interface.

---

## 🎯 Objective

The main objective of this project is to:

* Predict Super Store sales using Machine Learning.
* Implement the K-Nearest Neighbors Regression algorithm.
* Perform data preprocessing and feature scaling.
* Train and evaluate the regression model.
* Save the trained model using Pickle.
* Deploy the model using Flask.
* Provide predictions through a simple web application.

---

## 🧠 Machine Learning Model

This project uses **K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) Regression**.

KNN Regression predicts the sales value by finding the nearest and most similar data points in the dataset and using their values to estimate the output.

